% expect-output: true
% Scenario: a pattern is defined and found. The instance under /Dots in
% the Pattern category is instantiated and painted with, and its status
% stays true.
/Dots << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> /Pattern defineresource pop
/Dots /Pattern findresource matrix makepattern setpattern
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
/Dots /Pattern resourcestatus 3 1 roll pop pop =
